    "original_requirement": "实现一个简化电梯楼层与载荷监控系统，使用按钮 D2、D3、D4 表示到达 1 到 3 层，重量传感器 A0 表示载荷，蜂鸣器 D6、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和 LED D13。系统显示当前楼层和载荷百分比；若载荷超限则蜂鸣报警并阻止楼层变化。按钮触发楼层切换时需要模拟移动延时，并在串口输出 movement complete。",
    "effective_requirement": "实现一个简化电梯楼层与载荷监控系统，使用按钮 D2、D3、D4 表示到达 1 到 3 层，重量传感器 A0 表示载荷，蜂鸣器 D6、TM1637（CLK=D7，DIO=D5）和 LED D13。系统显示当前楼层和载荷百分比；若载荷超限则蜂鸣报警并阻止楼层变化。按钮触发楼层切换时需要模拟移动延时，并在串口输出 movement complete。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D2\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D3\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_input\", \"pin\": \"D4\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D7\", \"dio_pin\": \"D5\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
